{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15245120","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15245120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1524511001:":{"text":"상처가 아물고 있어요!","source_cn":"伤口开始愈合了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x789B8ABEC123885E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1524511002:":{"text":"다행이다... 엄마...","source_cn":"太好了……阿娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D759765F67FDDEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1524513001:":{"text":"여기는...","source_cn":"我这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB89A950D1D7A6E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1524513003:":{"text":"엄마, 일어났구나!","source_cn":"阿娘，你终于醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB4D08BE93DA4A25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1524513002:":{"text":"다운샤프? 여기서 뭐 하고 있는 거니?","source_cn":"绒利？你怎么在这？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E4E5659A6769BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1524513004:":{"text":"흐어엉... 다행이야...","source_cn":"呜呜……太好了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEC6C3016EC9F859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1524512001:1":{"text":"상처가 아물기 시작했다는 건 고비를 넘겼다는 뜻이지요. 프레이즈가 깨어나면 한시름 놓을 수 있을 겁니다.","source_cn":"伤口开始愈合，说明她已经暂时脱离危险了。接下来只要等她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3220CE20E75FE17E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1524512002:1":{"text":"부상이 정말 깊었는데, 강력한 마법 덕분에 목숨을 건졌군요.","source_cn":"她这次伤得不轻，幸好有你们这么强大的魔法帮忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AC2724918509224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1524512003:1":{"text":"네. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 선생님이 있어서 다행이에요...","source_cn":"嗯，幸好有<style=stress><player_...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFA7D72A29BFB9E05","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 선생님이 있어서 다행이에요...","female":"네. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 선생님이 있어서 다행이에요...","variant_male_record_index":"194208","variant_female_record_index":"194209","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1524512004:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 선생님, 엄마를 구해주셔서 정말 감사합니다...!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC213C56B21B9F475","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","m